LAMMPS (12 Jun 2025)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# MD relaxation at different temperatures
# Temperature range: 100, 200, 400, 600, 800, 1000 K
# Relaxation time: 20 ps
# Output: {temperature}k.lmp

# ===== Variable definitions =====
variable dt equal 0.0002           # Timestep 0.2 fs
variable run_time equal 10.0       # Relaxation time 10.0 ps
variable run_steps equal ${run_time}/${dt}
variable run_steps equal 10/${dt}
variable run_steps equal 10/0.0002
variable seed equal 224456

# Constraint parameters
variable z_fixwall equal 5.0
variable z_Si_soft_limit equal 16.5
variable Si_wall_k equal 10.0
variable z_upwall equal 50.0

# ===== System setup =====
units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array sort 0 0.0

# Read structure
read_data nve_atomic.lmp
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (98.26 85.096 100)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  10800 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  10800 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.085 seconds

# Potential function setup
pair_style deepmd graph_compressed_20241109_clean_2.pb
Summary of lammps deepmd module ...
  >>> Info of deepmd-kit:
  installed to:       /home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/soft/deepmd-kit-3.1.0/install
  source:             
  source branch:      
  source commit:      
  source commit at:   
  support model ver.: 1.1 
  build variant:      cuda
  build with tf inc:  /home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/.conda/envs/dp310/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorflow/include;/home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/.conda/envs/dp310/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorflow/include
  build with tf lib:  /home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/.conda/envs/dp310/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorflow/libtensorflow_cc.so.2
  set tf intra_op_parallelism_threads: 0
  set tf inter_op_parallelism_threads: 0
  >>> Info of lammps module:
  use deepmd-kit at:  /home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/soft/deepmd-kit-3.1.0/install
  source:             
  source branch:      
  source commit:      
  source commit at:   
  build with inc:     
  build with lib:     /home/bingxing2/home/scx7113/.conda/envs/dp310/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorflow
pair_coeff * * Si O O

# Neighbor list
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

# Define atom groups
group Si_atoms type 1
3600 atoms in group Si_atoms
group O_surface type 2
7200 atoms in group O_surface
group O_adsorbed type 3
0 atoms in group O_adsorbed
group Si_O_atoms type 1 2
10800 atoms in group Si_O_atoms

# ===== Fix bottom atoms =====
region bottom block INF INF INF INF 0 ${z_fixwall}
region bottom block INF INF INF INF 0 5
group fixed_atoms region bottom
3600 atoms in group fixed_atoms
fix 1 fixed_atoms setforce 0 0 0

# ===== Si and surface O height constraint (optional) =====
# fix Si_wall Si_O_atoms wall/harmonic zhi ${z_Si_soft_limit} ${Si_wall_k} 0.0 1.5 units box pbc yes

# ===== Define thermostated region once (outside loop) =====
region thermo_region block INF INF INF INF ${z_fixwall} ${z_upwall}
region thermo_region block INF INF INF INF 5 ${z_upwall}
region thermo_region block INF INF INF INF 5 50
group thermo_atoms region thermo_region
7200 atoms in group thermo_atoms

# Output settings
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal atoms
thermo_modify lost warn flush yes

timestep ${dt}
timestep 0.0002

# ===== Temperature loop =====
label temp_loop

variable temps index 1000

# Setup NVT ensemble (csvr thermostat)
fix 2 thermo_atoms nve
fix 3 thermo_atoms temp/csvr ${temps} ${temps} 0.01 ${seed}
fix 3 thermo_atoms temp/csvr 1000 ${temps} 0.01 ${seed}
fix 3 thermo_atoms temp/csvr 1000 1000 0.01 ${seed}
fix 3 thermo_atoms temp/csvr 1000 1000 0.01 224456

print "=========================================="
==========================================
print "Starting relaxation at ${temps} K"
Starting relaxation at 1000 K
print "=========================================="
==========================================

# Run relaxation
run ${run_steps}
run 50000

